    <listOfParameters>
      <parameter sboTerm="SBO:0000002" id="f_renal_function" name="renal function" value="1" units="dimensionless" constant="true">
        <notes>
          <body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
            <blockquote>
              <p>1.0: increased kidney function
1.0: normal kidney function (healthy control)
&lt;1.0: decreased kidney function</p>
            </blockquote>
          </body>
        </notes>
      </parameter>
      <parameter sboTerm="SBO:0000002" id="GFR_base" name="glomerular filtration rate (base)" value="100" units="ml_per_min" constant="true"/>
      <parameter sboTerm="SBO:0000009" id="HCTZEX_f" name="intrinsic renal clearance of hydrochlorothiazide relative to the GFR" value="3.23772819218966" units="dimensionless" constant="true">
        <notes>
          <body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
            <p>The intrinsic renal clearance of HCTZ is HCTZEX_f times the GFR
(filtration and secretion), acting on the renal venous plasma of a
well-stirred kidney: the systemic renal clearance is
Qki * CLint/(Qki + CLint), limited by the renal blood flow (2.26
GFR at renal function 1 with HCTZEX_f 2.68, 2.63 at 0.1 and 1.96
at 2). It scales with the body weight as the GFR does (linearly).</p>
          </body>
        </notes>
